==English==
[[File:Clupea sprattus.jpg|thumb|a European sprat, {{taxlink|Sprattus sprattus|species}}]]
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|sprotte}}, from {{inh|en|ang|sprot}}. Older source is unknown. Cognate with {{cog|de|Sprotte}},  {{cog|nl|sprot}}. Compare {{m|en|sprout}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/spɹæt/}}
* {{rhymes|en|æt|s=1}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|sprat|s}}

# Any of various small, [[herring]]-like, marine fish in the genus {{taxlink|Sprattus|genus|noshow=1}}, in the family [[Clupeidae]].
# {{lb|en|UK|slang|obsolete}} A [[sixpence]].

====Derived terms====
* {{l|en|a sprat to catch a mackerel}}
* {{l|en|spratlike}}

